      "llm_score": 2,
      "corrected_score": 3,
      "comment": "Claude flagged that pe_004’s null match_score is unexplained and said the rationale must state whether same_person was called. That’s the right check for an audit. Not calling same_person itself isn’t a gap, since the test asks for analysis only, so the LLM shouldn’t deduct for it."
    },
    {
